'' RUN: std/os phase P4 -- Args, GetEnv unset vs empty, a Unicode value round trip that ENVIRON
'' agrees with, Environment, ExpandEnv ($, ${}, % on Windows), name validation and the error
'' message, host facts, CatchInterrupt / WaitInterrupt / InterruptContext without an interrupt,
'' and ExitWith's code (C:\dev\docs\tiko-stdlib\RFC-0001 section 8).  The SIGINT half is compiled
'' for Linux and run there by hand; Windows' CTRL_BREAK case needs std/process (P5).
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 -mt tests/codegen/src/std-os-p4.tiko -o tests/codegen/stdosp4.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/codegen/stdosp4.exe
'' RUN: tests/codegen/stdosp4.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: ok
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 7
